# Workspace write scope

## WRITE

Only modify files under the `uni-oc3` repository.

## READ-ONLY (never modify / create / delete / format / stage / commit)

- `reference-uni-oc4`
- `reference-jet-oc3`
- `reference-oc3-store`
- `reference-oc3-core`
- `uni.avalonbg.com` (local CP reference copy — inspection only, not active CP development)

If a task appears to require changes outside `uni-oc3`: STOP, report the proposed external change, and do not implement it.
